---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION, getBusinessTenure, BUSINESS_START_DATE, OWNER_NAME, SERVICE_AREA, CONTACT_EMAIL, getAge, BIRTHDATE } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Future Wife and a Mother of 2"
	pubDate={new Date('July 03 2025')}
	heroImage="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg"
>
	<p>
		Meet {OWNER_NAME}

  Hi, I’m {OWNER_NAME}—the owner and the person behind {SITE_TITLE}!

  Cleaning has been a part of my life for as long as I can remember. I grew up watching my mom build and run her own cleaning business, and I spent my summers helping her. Without realizing it at the time, those experiences gave me the foundation for what would eventually become my own business.

  After my mom retired, I spent two years working for two different cleaning companies. Those experiences taught me a lot about the industry, but eventually I realized I wanted to take everything I had learned and create something of my own.

  So, in July 2025, I took the leap and started {SITE_TITLE}.

  I chose cleaning because I genuinely enjoy it. There’s something incredibly satisfying—and honestly, relaxing—about taking a space that needs some attention and turning it into a clean, refreshed home. I love seeing the transformation and knowing that the work I do can make someone’s life just a little bit easier.

  Owning my own business also allows me to create a schedule that works with my family and my children’s school schedules. That flexibility means I can do work that I love while still making time for the people who matter most to me.

  But my favorite part?

  My clients.

  There’s nothing better than leaving a home knowing my client is happy with the work I’ve done. That feeling of accomplishment is one of the biggest reasons I love what I do.

  And if you have pets, there’s a pretty good chance I’ll love them too! 🐾 I’m an animal lover, so meeting my clients’ furry family members is definitely one of the perks of the job.

  About Cleaning by Cassi

  Cleaning by Cassi was built on experience, hard work, and a genuine love for helping people feel better in their homes.

  I understand that life gets busy. Sometimes cleaning falls to the bottom of the list, and that’s okay. That’s where I come in.

  My goal isn’t just to clean your home—it’s to give you back time, take something off your plate, and leave you with a space you can enjoy.

  Every home is different, and every client has different needs. I believe your cleaning service should reflect that, which is why I take the time to understand what matters most to you and your home.

  I’m not just cleaning houses. I’m building relationships, one home at a time.

  Thank you for considering Cleaning by Cassi and for trusting me with your home. I truly appreciate every client who gives me the opportunity to do what I love. 💗
	</p>
</Layout>

<script define:vars={{ birthdate: BIRTHDATE.toISOString(), startDate: BUSINESS_START_DATE.toISOString() }}>
	function getAge(birthISO, from) {
		const birth = new Date(birthISO);
		let age = from.getFullYear() - birth.getFullYear();
		const monthDiff = from.getMonth() - birth.getMonth();
		if (monthDiff < 0 || (monthDiff === 0 && from.getDate() < birth.getDate())) age--;
		return age;
	}

	function getTenure(startISO, from) {
		const start = new Date(startISO);
		const months = (from.getFullYear() - start.getFullYear()) * 12 + (from.getMonth() - start.getMonth());
		if (months < 12) return `${months} month${months === 1 ? '' : 's'}`;
		const years = Math.floor(months / 12);
		return `${years} year${years === 1 ? '' : 's'}`;
	}

	const now = new Date();
	document.getElementById('owner-age').textContent = getAge(birthdate, now);
	document.getElementById('business-tenure').textContent = getTenure(startDate, now);
</script>
